{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/17/4045050/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リハももう大詰めです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝から夜まで大変だけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな楽しんでやってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相変わらずご飯の争奪戦すごーいよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はトマトいっぱい入った"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サラダ確保して食べてん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トマトトマトトマトうおおお"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/17/4045050/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、最近やまとまとのことを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りーちゃんって呼んでます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りーちゃんのほっぺは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大福みたいにもちもちしてるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初日は北海道。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、研修旅行で北海道行ったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また行けるの嬉しいーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなカニカニ言ってるのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行った時に食べた海鮮丼が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忘れられない..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しすぎて感動したのー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イクラサーモン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/17/4045050/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとのことだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その分ね、うん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私からも、考えを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアーが終わったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"数日で夏休みが終わっちゃうよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーまた3rd個人pvみたいに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旅したいな。できれば一人で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朗読したいな。浪漫みたいな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんなもの見て刺激を、しゅわっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかくライブ楽しみーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/17/4045050/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は美味しいタルトを、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘いもの、食べちゃったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今からいっぱい動いて消費しなきゃ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/17/4045050/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハッハッハッハッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/17/4045050/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}